# SABOTAGE: T82 fix-round nonce-cache ordering MED (ATK-7). Reverts
# Samen.Web.Fleet.Ingress.verify_inbound/3 to consume the anti-replay
# nonce BEFORE signature verification, so an entirely unauthenticated
# request (any garbage signature) writes a NonceCache row for the
# {kid, nonce} pair — letting an attacker who knows only a victim's kid
# burn/poison a nonce a legitimate request would later present, on an
# unrate-limited route.
# APP: samen_web
# TEST_FILES: test/samen/web/fleet_ingress_test.exs
